# CRM Kai — Agent Rules

**Start:** `docs/00-overview/ONBOARDING.md` → `PROJECT-STATUS.md` → `IRON-RULES.md`

## Must read before implement

| Task | File |
|------|------|
| Any work | `PROJECT-STATUS.md` (code vs docs) |
| Don't guess decisions | `DECISIONS.md` |
| SQL / migrations | `06-crm-schema/tables.md` + `06-crm-schema/DATA-CHANGE-LOG.md` + `02-database/PHASE-MATRIX.md` |
| Phase 1 scope | `07-phases/PHASE-1-CHECKLIST.md` |
| UI strings / i18n | `12-i18n/README.md` — **th + en always**, no hardcoded UI text |
| Typography / fonts | `12-i18n/TYPOGRAPHY.md` — **IBM Plex Sans Thai** (Headline 600 · Body 400) |
| Logo / brand | `05-frontend/BRAND-ASSETS.md` — `public/images/logo/*.webp` |
| Glossary | `GLOSSARY.md` |
| QA / tester / bug report | `11-dev-setup/QA-GUIDE.md` → checklist โมดูลใน `QA-*.md` |

## Current phase: 1

- Single Supabase + org_id on CRM tables
- No Node API, no landing/register, no multi-tenant
- 1 user = 1 org (no organization_members)
- UI: Nuxt UI · Auth: Supabase · i18n: th + en (D-009)

## After every change

CHANGELOG in affected folder(s); DB → DB-CHANGELOG + DB-SCHEMA; data changes → `data_change_logs` (IRON-RULES §13)

## Phase 3+ docs

Marked ⚪ in READMEs — do NOT implement until phase changes

**org** = SaaS tenant | **company** = CRM customer
